### --- ADMINISTRATOR (ADMIN) ---

### 1. Retrieve administrator token
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/ev-network/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=ev-frontend&client_secret=secret&username=admin_user&password=admin123&grant_type=password

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 2. Retrieve all stations (GET - successful for ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 3. Create new station (POST - successful for ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chernivtsi Main Hub",
  "location": "вул. Університетська 28, Чернівці"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("station_id", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Full station update (PUT - successful for ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/stations/{{station_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chernivtsi Main Hub Updated",
  "location": "вул. Головна 100, Чернівці",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### --- REGULAR USER (CUSTOMER) ---

### 5. Retrieve regular user token
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/ev-network/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=ev-frontend&client_secret=secret&username=customer_user&password=customer123&grant_type=password

> {%
    client.global.set("customer_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 6. Retrieve all stations (GET - successful for CUSTOMER)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### 7. NEGATIVE TEST: Create station with CUSTOMER token (Expected 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker Station",
  "location": "Нелегальна локація"
}